<Positioned left="48" top="194">
  <Text color="#334155FF" fontSize="24.0" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC"><![CDATA[解析器不做 HTML 实体解码：空格归谁、尖括号怎么写、八位色从哪一位算起。]]></Text>
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="256" width="4" height="22">
  <Container width="4" height="22" color="#7C3AEDFF" borderRadius="2" />
</Positioned>
<Positioned left="64" top="250">
